// 울릉도·독도 맵 에셋 팩 v1의 GLB 모델(scripts/import-glb-pack.py가 만들어요). 단위: 제작용 상대 단위, Y 위.
// pos Float32 x,y,z · nrm Int8 x,y,z(÷127) · col Uint8 r,g,b,재질(0 단색 · 1 층리 절벽 · 2 응회암 · 3 콘크리트 · 4 황토 바위 · 5 풀)
export const GLB_SURF = "scenery/glb-surf";
export const GLB_MODELS = {"railing": {"n": 324, "min": [-3.035, -0.0, -0.035], "max": [3.035, 1.1, 0.035], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "stairs": {"n": 864, "min": [-0.8103, -0.0, -4.275], "max": [0.8103, 3.0314, 0.225], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "tetrapod": {"n": 288, "min": [-1.2099, -0.5795, -1.2628], "max": [1.2099, 1.4, 0.8788], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "sutdol": {"n": 276, "min": [-2.1125, 0.0, -1.7312], "max": [2.2645, 6.0, 1.6301], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "tanggeon": {"n": 324, "min": [-3.1214, 0.0, -2.5097], "max": [2.9303, 10.0, 2.9277], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "candle": {"n": 252, "min": [-1.8524, 0.0, -1.2899], "max": [1.8284, 7.0, 1.2954], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "independence": {"n": 144, "min": [-5.2, 0.0, -2.0], "max": [4.8, 7.28, 2.0], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "elephant": {"n": 516, "min": [-11.5294, 0.0, -3.9499], "max": [5.4, 8.0, 4.3173], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "three_caves": {"n": 432, "min": [-7.0006, 0.0, -5.0019], "max": [5.4, 8.32, 3.6378], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "helipad": {"n": 144, "min": [-2.5, 0.0, -2.5], "max": [2.5, 0.15, 2.5], "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "bochal": {"n": 330, "min": [-1.8, 0.0, -1.4], "max": [1.8, 2.5, 1.4], "anchor": [33.5, 21.5], "map": "route4", "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "sangjanggun": {"n": 330, "min": [-1.0, 0.0, -0.9], "max": [1.0, 5.0, 0.9], "anchor": [27, 14.5], "map": "route6", "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "hanbando": {"n": 2076, "min": [-3.5, 0.0, -2.3659], "max": [3.5, 4.6737, 2.3659], "anchor": [23.5, 10.5], "map": "town2", "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "cheonjanggul": {"n": 492, "min": [-5.0, 0.0, -2.5], "max": [5.0, 1.6634, 2.5], "anchor": [21, 15.5], "map": "town1", "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}, "dongdo_pier": {"n": 1356, "min": [-6.5, -1.0, -4.555], "max": [6.555, 0.84, 4.555], "anchor": [8.5, 21.5], "map": "route0", "pos": "", "nrm": "", "col": ""}};
const b64 = s => { const bin = atob(s), u = new Uint8Array(bin.length); for (let i = 0; i < bin.length; i++) u[i] = bin.charCodeAt(i); return u.buffer; };
const cache = new Map();
// 모델 하나를 풀어요(한 번만): { n, min, max, pos: Float32Array, nrm: Int8Array, col: Uint8Array }
export function glbModel(id) {
  if (cache.has(id)) return cache.get(id); const m = GLB_MODELS[id]; if (!m) return null;
  const out = { n: m.n, min: m.min, max: m.max, pos: new Float32Array(b64(m.pos)), nrm: new Int8Array(b64(m.nrm)), col: new Uint8Array(b64(m.col)) };
  cache.set(id, out); return out;
}
